name: Invisible Joker — duplicator
author: corpus
description: >-
  After 2 rounds, sell Invisible Joker to duplicate a random Joker (removes Negative from
  the copy). First-shop copy engine: duplicate a strong rare/legendary payoff or another
  Invisible Joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: InvisibleJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Brainstorm
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
